tHub → Netlify (automated)\n\n---\n\n## 5. IMPLEMENTATION TIMELINE\n\n**Phase 1 (Today - July 31, 2026)**:\n- ✓ Confirm workflow details (8 AM daily, combined inventory, services, portfolio)\n- ✓ Set up Gumroad store with initial product inventory\n- ✓ Configure Pipedream webhook for daily automation\n- ✓ Deploy animated portfolio to Netlify\n\n**Phase 2 (August 1–7, 2026)**:\n- Launch daily 8 AM automated product generation\n- Publish initial 10 products (5 streetwear + 5 stationery)\n- Set up social media automation\n\n**Phase 3 (August 8–31, 2026)**:\n- Monitor daily product performance\n- Gather customer feedback\n- Scale custom services intake\n\n---\n\n**Status**: Ready for Pipedream automation setup and Gumroad publishing.\n\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-31T22:42:23.188Z\"}"